Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.51,0:00:05.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the heck was that all about, Inaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.30,0:00:09.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Iori's {\i0}my{\i1} woman!\N{\i1}Keep your hands off her!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.18,0:00:12.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing you need to get worked up about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.64,0:00:16.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I set you up as an obstacle for Fujishima.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:21.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you just need to do one little thing, and you'll save Iori from the hands of Fujishima.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.74,0:00:23.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:28.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q0}I don't want to make an enemy out of anyone in the class.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.91,0:00:32.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone, except yourself, is an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.91,0:00:34.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.46,0:00:35.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Taichi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.29,0:00:38.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you're in love with Iori, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.10,0:02:15.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm in love with Nagase?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.22,0:02:18.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How'd we get on this topic anyway?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.73,0:02:22.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your reactions have been over-the-top lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:25.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They were a lot duller before all this started.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.23,0:02:27.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just being put in situations where I have to react like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.03,0:02:35.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just win Iori over before Fujishima beats you to the punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.58,0:02:35.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I asked how we got on this topic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.83,0:02:38.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Fujishima's a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.16,0:02:41.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fighting someone to save another.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:45.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's how you like it.\NRight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:48.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Selfless freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.47,0:02:55.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by "selfless freak"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.10,0:02:57.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exactly what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.14,0:03:01.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why'd you volunteer yourself for this waste of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.06,0:03:05.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If no one wants to do it, then I have to take it on myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.98,0:03:09.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That way, no one has to suffer through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.82,0:03:13.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that makes you a selfless freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.33,0:03:17.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you like professional wrestling?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.20,0:03:18.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the art of receiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.87,0:03:24.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A wrestling match isn't about who can pull off better moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:28.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A good match is about a wrestler receiving the moves, making the other wrestler look better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:33.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q0}My favorite wrestlers are the ones called "jobbers," who dedicate themselves to getting beaten—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.89,0:03:36.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you hopeless wrestling fanatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.64,0:03:38.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you asked!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.64,0:03:40.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Back to Iori.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.43,0:03:44.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.43,0:03:46.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's the weakest link in the CRC.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.15,0:03:50.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone so close to breaking down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.65,0:03:54.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that weakness is exactly what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.37,0:03:59.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You have to be her shield, \Nget hurt for her, and protect her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.91,0:04:04.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect job for a selfless freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:08.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't analyze me like that.\NI've never thought anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.05,0:04:13.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,While we're on the subject, I should tell you that Iori's in love with you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.88,0:04:16.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like that could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.14,0:04:18.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a boring reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.76,0:04:22.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She needs someone to set her identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:26.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone who can tell her who she is no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.27,0:04:31.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus, you two put on a good show when you're together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.19,0:04:32.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.03,0:04:35.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, either way, it's your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.49,0:04:37.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You do what you want with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.74,0:04:43.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Iori's definitely the most vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.54,0:04:44.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vulnerable?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:50.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This personality switching can ruin any of us at any time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:53.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q0}but if there's anyone who comes off worse every time, it's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.05,0:04:55.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Comes off worse"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.01,0:04:59.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, we've only run into some minor trouble so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.60,0:05:01.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think you need to be so serious—{Why so serious?}{Let's put a smile on that face}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.10,0:05:03.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How stupid are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.81,0:05:05.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can you be so calm about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.73,0:05:11.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've convinced me. {\i1}You{\i0} are the slowest out of all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.19,0:05:13.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This whole affair is a {\i1}disaster{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.78,0:05:17.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We don't know who, where,\Nor when any of us could get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.49,0:05:20.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:23.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:28.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I went a bit too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:32.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been a long day, and the stress is getting to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.34,0:05:35.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.01,0:05:38.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.47,0:05:43.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course. It's not like you said anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.93,0:05:46.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.02,0:05:52.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's get back to picking up the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.44,0:05:54.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We won't get anything done if we keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.40,0:05:56.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really are slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.61,0:06:05.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your trash bag got blown away a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.53,0:06:05.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say anything?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.25,0:06:08.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where'd it go?\NOh, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.37,0:06:12.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because it'd be more interesting if I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:20.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:22.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I always treat you so badly because I don't know how to react.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.64,0:06:27.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The truth is...\Nthat I love you, Aoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.02,0:06:30.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to bring this up all of a sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.52,0:06:35.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I can't keep lying to myself about how I feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.23,0:06:37.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you go out with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.24,0:06:40.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you get that?\NI got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.91,0:06:43.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.54,0:06:48.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You know,\NI've always...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:50.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:52.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.09,0:06:57.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, if you don't mind, will you go out with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.30,0:06:59.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes! This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.26,0:07:01.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba-chan is always so direct and manly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.22,0:07:04.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q0}But when I see her making such a girly confession... My heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:07.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yours is everything you've ever wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.85,0:07:10.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.85,0:07:13.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope I can get her to say it to me one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:17.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that's enough for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.23,0:07:18.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Time to delete.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.65,0:07:21.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.28,0:07:22.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're not done just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.45,0:07:25.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's do some more before Yui and Inaba-chan get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:30.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We might not get another chance like this!\NRight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.87,0:07:32.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.00,0:07:35.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yui, get those phones!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:36.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.97,0:07:47.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}impossible{\i0} to move in this body!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.10,0:07:51.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi, you need to get more exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.19,0:07:56.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You know,\NI've always...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.23,0:07:58.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.19,0:08:00.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.49,0:08:04.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, if you don't mind, will you go out with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.91,0:08:08.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What an {\i1}interesting{\i0} way to pass the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.71,0:08:13.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Inaba, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.83,0:08:19.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What am I doing? Just getting ready to run around school naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.84,0:08:23.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,P-Please don't, Inaba-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.51,0:08:28.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you do that, I'll die socially!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.51,0:08:29.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.10,0:08:35.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.10,0:08:37.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba-san, if I die socially, I don't think I can go on living biologically!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.73,0:08:39.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quiet! You asked for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.19,0:08:46.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen up. If you do it again, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.37,0:08:48.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!\NI'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.49,0:08:53.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm mad at you too.\NIf you do it again, you're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.37,0:08:54.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.67,0:08:57.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Iori?\NDid she come in today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.13,0:09:00.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but she said that she had something to do, then left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.13,0:09:03.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, I've been meaning to ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.97,0:09:07.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yui, are you scared of us two or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:12.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I'm in your body...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:14.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whenever a guy comes close, your body starts shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.49,0:09:26.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.41,0:09:33.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who in their right mind\Nwould ever be...\Nscared of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.50,0:09:35.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um... Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.75,0:09:41.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely stronger than both of you, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.63,0:09:46.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So...\NI'm not scared of men!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.85,0:09:51.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.43,0:09:55.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I kept saying that I love you, but I never noticed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:59.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...\NI'm the stupidest idiot on the face of the planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:03.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.61,0:10:06.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.32,0:10:10.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go and calm her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.49,0:10:13.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba-chan, did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.58,0:10:17.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NShe was really good at hiding it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.58,0:10:20.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so it's normal that you wouldn't notice,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.54,0:10:23.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but it's still a big problem for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.42,0:10:32.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All I can do is lighten the shock.\NThe rest is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.27,0:10:39.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of my own stupidity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.06,0:10:41.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't kill yourself over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.61,0:10:45.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba just said that she was really good at hiding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.53,0:10:49.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I didn't even notice when I was in Kiriyama's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.11,0:10:52.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there were plenty of hints along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.82,0:10:59.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the CRC, Inaba-chan always hits us because she's angry, or rather, just violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:03.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Iori-chan's all about being touchy-feely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.54,0:11:09.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We should've noticed it was weird that Yui wouldn't join in,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.68,0:11:11.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,considering she's so lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:14.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're pretty sharp, Aoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.51,0:11:17.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're talking about the girl I love here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.68,0:11:20.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You haven't changed a bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.85,0:11:24.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,even with this personality switching and all the other chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.53,0:11:30.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q0}My philosophy is that everything's fine as long as we're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.78,0:11:34.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think that's all that's important,\Nand that'll never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.12,0:11:42.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I just hope we can look back on this personality switching one day and laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.96,0:11:47.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that might not be possible anymore.\NI hurt Yui pretty badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:51.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What am I getting so serious about?{Why so serious?}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.55,0:11:52.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not me at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:56.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get the feeling you're more amazing than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.89,0:11:59.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.52,0:12:06.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm starting to think you'd do better with Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.73,0:12:09.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said that I was amazing,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:13.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but in terms of potential, you're way above me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.41,0:12:15.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Potential for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.41,0:12:19.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a natural at it, so you haven't realized it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.16,0:12:20.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but you're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.83,0:12:24.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't even know what I need to do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.62,0:12:28.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NHow can we save Kiriyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.96,0:12:31.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.96,0:12:32.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what's so amazing about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.59,0:12:35.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You jump right to saving her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.63,0:12:35.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's thinking big!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.93,0:12:40.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like I'm thinking anything big.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:43.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What scares me is that you might just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:48.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if that happens...\NYui might fall for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.40,0:12:49.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.57,0:12:52.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll call Yui and apologize later!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.61,0:12:55.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi! You haven't won yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.70,0:13:01.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.41,0:13:08.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. If that's what you want, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:20.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you like this duo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.22,0:13:20.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.89,0:13:24.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a special on wrestling tonight, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.60,0:13:27.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After this show's over, okay?{RINAAAAAA}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.23,0:13:27.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.91,0:13:50.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kiriyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.71,0:13:54.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kiriyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.26,0:13:58.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.51,0:14:00.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was kind of crying,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.51,0:14:04.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but don't let it bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.10,0:14:04.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, could you forget about it?\NKiriyama...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.03,0:14:07.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,can we meet up right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.85,0:14:12.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.48,0:14:15.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q0}I panicked a bit, so your sister might think something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.61,0:14:21.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone's been getting suspicious of us lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.07,0:14:21.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.20,0:14:27.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aoki called me right before we switched.\NHe apologized like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:31.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:37.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was thinking that the both of you might not know how to approach me anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.01,0:14:43.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that we might not be able to have as much fun as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.68,0:14:46.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I started hating myself for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.68,0:14:49.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kiriyama, are you afraid of men?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:51.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.31,0:14:54.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there a reason why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.82,0:14:58.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If so, would you mind telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.82,0:15:04.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You always jump right to the point, don't you, Taichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.78,0:15:04.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll be the second person to hear my story, after Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.75,0:15:15.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I was in middle school, a man attempted to rape me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.30,0:15:17.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Luckily, it was nothing more than an attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.76,0:15:21.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I fought back and got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.76,0:15:23.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that was back when I practiced karate all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:27.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd never lost to a boy before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.14,0:15:31.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd send them home crying if anything happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:33.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But when it actually happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.81,0:15:38.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it took all I had just to get away.\NDid you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.81,0:15:41.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Men are really, really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.41,0:15:45.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After that, I thought,\N"I'll never win against a man."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.99,0:15:52.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kiriyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.92,0:15:55.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:58.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't really want to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.09,0:16:01.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.88,0:16:01.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:04.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.76,0:16:06.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it's the same as saying, "Save me."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.76,0:16:09.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.68,0:16:14.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd be causing you trouble because I'm too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:19.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.99,0:16:25.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it's more trouble if you stay afraid of men.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.74,0:16:25.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be like this either!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.16,0:16:28.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.16,0:16:30.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then let me help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.99,0:16:30.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't like it either!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.62,0:16:34.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just said so!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.33,0:16:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll show you that you can't lose to any man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.84,0:16:42.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The way you're looking at me is kind of scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.22,0:16:45.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.14,0:16:46.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grab my shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.32,0:17:08.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even just watching is pretty painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:11.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:12.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you get it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.95,0:17:16.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can take down any guy in one—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.46,0:17:19.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.75,0:17:21.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.76,0:17:29.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was the most painful thing I've ever felt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.22,0:17:32.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.27,0:17:35.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi, someone's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.52,0:17:39.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should we find somewhere to hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.52,0:17:44.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It might mean trouble if someone saw us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.69,0:17:44.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind me. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:45.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.90,0:17:47.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,go on...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.90,0:17:49.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't the time for cool movie lines!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.53,0:17:51.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No... I'm serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.04,0:17:56.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, you two...\NOh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.80,0:17:59.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up!{I want to hold hands with Yui}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.17,0:18:08.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kiriyama, I think this is far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.01,0:18:11.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.06,0:18:14.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way.\NWhen did I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.31,0:18:18.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't give it a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.31,0:18:21.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's because we had to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.52,0:18:21.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And it's you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.94,0:18:24.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More importantly, what the heck was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.53,0:18:26.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a girl! Why do I have to feel a man's pain?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.90,0:18:29.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it worked, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.45,0:18:32.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, sure, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.45,0:18:36.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it the same for every man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.95,0:18:36.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.20,0:18:39.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it's not just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.66,0:18:42.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.25,0:18:44.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really can't do anything after something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.55,0:18:49.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One clean hit and I've won!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.38,0:18:56.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll practice more at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.80,0:19:01.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have I unleashed a weapon of mass destruction upon the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:19:01.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:19:03.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you go that far for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.36,0:19:05.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You even hurt your own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.03,0:19:08.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is "I wanted to" good enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.54,0:19:11.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's so you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:26.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.01,0:19:33.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yaegashi-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.67,0:19:35.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,were you with a girl at the park on 5th Street last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.72,0:19:40.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.72,0:19:47.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I saw you all over a small, long-haired girl there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.19,0:19:49.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I take my dog on walks through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.61,0:19:54.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got the wrong guy.\NWell, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.03,0:19:57.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I might be wrong, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.83,0:20:01.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If so, sorry for suspecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.83,0:20:02.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And here I thought I caught you cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.84,0:20:09.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning, Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.01,0:20:12.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kiriyama...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.93,0:20:17.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Could you stop that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.89,0:20:23.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, Taichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.35,0:20:27.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I'm starting to get interested in things like martial arts and wrestling again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.48,0:20:30.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can talk about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.49,0:20:32.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course! Anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.49,0:20:35.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even right now would be perfectly—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.49,0:20:35.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not right now! Not right now!\NMaybe later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.59,0:20:38.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.12,0:20:45.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go get 'em, Kiriyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.29,0:20:48.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think that meant?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.05,0:20:50.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.46,0:20:52.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something happened between you yesterday!\NWhat did you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.09,0:20:56.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I didn't really do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.09,0:21:00.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just kind of listened to what she had to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.27,0:21:02.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, not like it matters to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.10,0:21:05.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it matters to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.10,0:21:08.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can you get close like that just by listening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.44,0:21:11.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori-chan, we need a battle plan!\NI said that it doesn't matter to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.99,0:21:18.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.16,0:21:21.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.16,0:21:26.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just gave her a little push.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.21,0:21:34.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess good things can come from this personality switching too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.13,0:21:35.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All I could see was disaster...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.60,0:21:37.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.26,0:21:42.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.64,0:21:45.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba, what's wrong?\NInaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.15,0:21:47.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Inaba?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.36,0:21:48.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.15,0:21:54.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know, Taichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.03,0:21:57.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.03,0:21:58.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have to take care of your own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.32,0:22:02.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought {\i1}he{\i0} might have done something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.61,0:22:02.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am I your enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.61,0:22:08.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And more than anything, actually feeling moved by it is stupid.
